Explanation: The theatrical release date in Germany is now 2026-12-03, and PVOD typically follows theatrical by 45 days. Therefore, the earliest PVOD release date would be 2027-01-07 (45 days after 2026-12-03). Since the proposed PVOD date is 2027-01-20, it falls within the window after the theatrical release. However, since the exact PVOD window details are not provided, we assume that the window has not yet opened, hence the "window_not_open" constraint.
